#: blackjack.py:42
msgid ""
"**Quick Blackjack rules:**\n"
"• **Hit**: Draw another card.\n"
"• **Stand**: Keep your current hand.\n"
"• **Double Down**: Double the bet for this hand, take exactly 1 more card and stand.\n"
"• **Split**: If your first 2 cards have the same value you can split them into 2 hands (extra bet equal to the base bet).\n"
"• The dealer stands on 17 or more.\n"
"• Going over 21 loses.\n"
"• Blackjack = 21 with 2 cards.\n"
msgstr ""

